From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Projet AuxiNux <repo@auxinux.ca>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 18:15:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] startpage: AuxiNux home screen, About legal notices and no
 online templates

The start page loads the AuxiNux module (auxinux_branding.js + auxinux.js, copied at build time) right after locale.js. Hooks: creation tiles and actions (new document/spreadsheet/presentation, open PDF, new text file, open a file), project link instead of the online help center, 'Free software and licenses' section in About, and no automatic request to the online template gallery (local templates are kept).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
